{"product_id":"hitlers-daughter","title":"Hitlers Daughter","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe bombs were falling and the smoke rising from the concentration camps, but all Hitler's daughter knew was the world of lessons with Fraulein Gelber and the hedgehogs she rescued from the cold. Was it just a story or did Hitler's daughter really exist? And if you were Hitler's daughter, would all the horror that occurred be your fault, too? Do things that happened a long time ago still matter?First published in 1999, Hitler's Daughter has sold over 100,000 copies in Australia alone and has received great critical acclaim, both in Australia and the twelve countries where it has been published. Hitler's Daughter has also won or been shortlisted for 23 awards, both in Australia and internationally, including winner of the 2000 Children's Book Council of Australia Book of the Year for Younger Readers.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jackie French\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780007122721\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45575464124569,"sku":"16RA-49780007122721","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/686e9505dcecc_Hitlers_Daughter_Jackie_French.jpg?v=1752513333","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/hitlers-daughter","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}